#! ia 1.0

@law canon-a6-source-roots
  meaning
    says "A repository root holds one .ia/src. Another .ia/src is nested inside it only for a separately released or adopted workspace."
    answers "How many .ia/src roots may a knowledge repository or a kit hold?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "In a knowledge repository or a kit, keep one .ia/src per repository root, and nest another only for a workspace that is separately released or adopted."
  subject
    subject-word workspace
  relationships
    cites @agent public-workspace-system-steward

@law canon-a14-work-placement
  meaning
    says "Work records (plans, milestones, tasks, decisions and specs) never sit inside a vocabulary system's folder."
    answers "Where may plans, milestones, tasks, decisions and specs be authored relative to vocabulary system folders?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "Author plans, milestones, tasks, decisions and specs outside every vocabulary system's folder under .ia/src/systems/."
  subject
    subject-word spec
  relationships
    cites @agent public-work-system-steward

@law canon-c4-kit-words
  meaning
    says "A kit's method system mints no words, and requires the systems whose vocabulary it uses."
    answers "May a kit's method system mint words, and which systems must it require?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "In a kit, give the method system no words of its own, and have it require every system whose words it uses."
  subject
    subject-word distribution
  relationships
    cites @agent public-workspace-system-steward

@law canon-c5a-kit-workspace
  meaning
    says "A kit's shipped workspace has no steward and no sources."
    answers "May the workspace a kit ships declare a steward or sources?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "Ship a kit's workspace without a steward and without sources."
  subject
    subject-word workspace
  relationships
    cites @agent public-workspace-system-steward

@law canon-c6-kit-scripts
  meaning
    says "A kit holds no scripts, and acts through an execution-binding."
    answers "How does a kit act without holding scripts?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "Keep scripts out of every kit, and have the kit act through an execution-binding."
  subject
    subject-word distribution
  relationships
    cites @agent public-workspace-system-steward

@law canon-c12-teaching-links
  meaning
    says "Markdown links in a shipped .ia/src stay inside that .ia/src, or are absolute URLs."
    answers "Where may a markdown link in a shipped .ia/src point?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "In a shipped .ia/src, write every markdown link as a path that stays inside that .ia/src, or as an absolute URL."
  subject
    subject-word distribution
  relationships
    cites @agent public-workspace-system-steward

@law canon-d9-no-secrets
  meaning
    says "Portable kit archives and generated public plugins hold no secrets."
    answers "May a portable kit archive or a generated public plugin carry a secret?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "Put no secret in a portable kit archive or in a generated public plugin."
  subject
    subject-word distribution
  relationships
    cites @agent public-workspace-system-steward

@law canon-e4-local-tighten
  meaning
    says "A local rule only tightens the rule it adds to, and cites what it tightens."
    answers "How may a local rule relate to the canon rule on the same word?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "Make a local rule on a canon rule's word cite the canon rule it tightens, and make it no weaker than that rule."
  subject
    subject-word law
  relationships
    cites @agent public-governance-system-steward

@law canon-e5-mandate-narrow
  meaning
    says "Mandates intersect and never widen: a mandate grants nothing the mandate it narrows does not."
    answers "May a mandate allow a move or cover a path that the mandate it cites does not?"
  governance
    severity advisory
    requires "Make a mandate that cites another mandate allow no move and cover no path that the cited mandate does not."
  subject
    subject-word mandate
  relationships
    cites @agent public-agent-system-steward
